TITLE 100C pure water pH 3 with minerals; find kaolinite dissolved
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings kaol_dissolved
10 PUNCH (10 - EQUI("Kaolinite"))
END
